      "key": "coverage_criteria_and_results",
      "statement": "All eight criteria apply: every known material evaluation has at least one capable frame; every material interaction has a declared evaluation/conjunction/translation/composition relation; every evaluation has semantic and decision authority and every material operation inherited operation authority; every mandatory claim has admissible evidence and refusal paths; required independent activation and assurance conditions exist; aggregation hides no unresolved conflict; exclusions cite governing authority; uncovered/unknown residuals are explicit and compatible. Evaluate every applicable criterion and required seam through RF-012 and core conjunction. Supported satisfaction of every required criterion gives satisfied; a demonstrated mandatory gap, unlawful exclusion or defeated criterion gives falsified; undecided criterion truth, including compatibility of conditions/conflicts/residuals, gives indeterminate subject to core precedence; unusable basis gives invalid_basis; material scope/capability outside the evaluator frame gives out_of_frame. Apply core missing-reason rules, retain ledger/leaves/performance/effects, distinguish successful audit performance from claim satisfaction and absent audit from any result.",
