          "quote": "Every field resolves through stable identities and source references. Paths,\nline numbers, member counts, summaries, and matching labels may aid navigation\nor diagnostics but do not substitute for the declared identity and basis.",
          "section_id": "repo://stdo-v3-generation-rc9/codex/5592168e26759f37e730aed12c030a6061709ec4/source/standards/REFERENCE_FRAME_METHOD.md#Reference%20Frame%20Method%2FAgentic%20Use%2FMinimal%20Frame%20Activation%20Binding",
          "start_line": 1188
