      "key": "agent_packet_binding_rules",
      "statement": "Supply one activated frame or declared active configuration, without implying reconstruction of the entire workspace from ambient context. Return through the declared result relation; internal reasoning cannot replace evidence, provenance or authority. Optimize frame size for reliable evaluation. Broader capable-agent frames and lawful less-capable-agent refinement preserve the same material invariants and authorities. Every activation field resolves through stable identities and source references; navigation aids, counts, summaries and matching labels cannot replace identity/basis.",
