      "conditions": [],
      "exceptions": ["Qualification may be staged; unevaluated functions or branches remain open.", "Prior exemplars become mandatory targets only if the governing basis explicitly requires equivalence."],
      "grounding": [
        {
          "end_line": 1360,
          "quote": "| `declare` | a frame set derived from a governed workspace, outcome, practices, capability envelopes, evaluation inventory, authority, and residual boundary; missing authority or evaluation basis refuses |\n| `activate` | exact subject/basis and capable-actor activation succeeds; stale, ambiguous, topology-mismatched, unauthorized, and capability-incompatible activations refuse or return the applicable closed pressure |\n| `evaluate` | representative `satisfied`, `falsified`, `indeterminate`, `out_of_frame`, and `invalid_basis` results; sensitivity to material changes and stability under established irrelevance |\n| `conjoin` | exercise [core conjunction](FOUNDATIONS.md#result-conjunction): all required claims and joins satisfied; an authenticated applicable failure retained beside missing coverage; invalid composite or required basis; required out-of-frame contribution; and unresolved mandatory contribution. Conflict, veto and refusal remain predicate-bound evidence or decision annotations, never replacement verdicts; preserve the core precedence and every frame's meaning |\n| `translate` | preserved coordinates and provenance reach the target; declared loss remains explicit; identity, basis, authority, or equality mismatch refuses |\n| `audit_coverage` | evaluation, interaction, semantic/operation/decision authority, failure, capability, and required independently activated or assurance-independent coverage map to capable frames or explicit residuals; artifact or actor count cannot close coverage |\n| `revise` | historical failure, topology mutation, evidence change, and capability change produce the declared frame-set delta and identify every prior activation, result, conjunction, and coverage claim requiring reevaluation |\n| result consumption | a declared consumer uses one closed result without importing hidden frame context or authority; insufficient output produces a reconstructability failure |\n| material composition | a case requiring cross-frame execution declares composition, order where material, closure, failure, and semantic/operation/decision-authority conservation; a case not requiring composition remains uncomposed |",
          "section_id": "repo://stdo-v3-generation-rc9/codex/5592168e26759f37e730aed12c030a6061709ec4/source/standards/REFERENCE_FRAME_METHOD.md#Reference%20Frame%20Method%2FFrame%20Qualification%2FMethod%20Self-Qualification",
          "start_line": 1352
        }
      ],
      "key": "self_qualification_population",
      "statement": "A fresh competent constructor works within declared capability/context/configuration using declared trials; an independently authorized evaluator compares exact stabilized results with all mandatory relations under externally supplied protocols. Exercise every claimed function/failure relation through positive, boundary and falsifying cases: declare from governed workspace/outcome/practices/capabilities/inventory/authority/residuals and refuse missing authority/basis; activate exact capable cases and refuse or return applicable closed pressure for stale, ambiguous, topology-mismatched, unauthorized or incompatible cases; evaluate all five outcomes with material sensitivity and established irrelevance stability; conjoin all required claims/joins while retaining authenticated failure beside missing coverage, invalid basis/composite, out-of-frame and unresolved contributions, with conflict/veto/refusal only predicate-bound annotations; translate preserving coordinates/provenance, explicit loss and refusal on identity/basis/authority/equality mismatch; audit evaluation/interaction/authority/failure/capability/required independence via capable frames or residuals, never counts; revise for history/topology/evidence/capability with all affected prior reliance identified; consume closed results without hidden context/authority, diagnosing insufficient output as reconstructability failure; compose only required cross-frame execution with material order, closure/failure and authority conservation. One declaration and coverage result establish only their evaluated populations. Every verdict states exact functions, revisions, envelopes, basis classes, branches and evidence populations. Optional prior exemplars may be comparison evidence after freeze.",
