      "statement": "Caller selects every native route/derived context; empty derived selection means selected none, not established semantic absence. Product Definition keeps composition ownership and cohort/Product release records keep member/release identity. Separate cohort-update presentation has no consumer effects; canonical acceptance object includes physical destinations/preimages/exact cohort and companion coordinates/replacement locators/routes/source observations. Installed status changes neither authority nor digest. Mutation requires explicit acceptance and rederivation of exact plan, with digest possession alone insufficient. adopt/sync/fleet retain narrower contracts. Verify cohort dependency closure and every companion definition/release/admitted members before reliance; stage missing immutable installs, verify existing without in-place repair, preflight all consumer targets. Change only selected basis/schema, existing composition locators/contracts and selected native/install links; preserve historical installs/unrelated content, create no local checker, change no Product meaning/local semantic map. Missing/ambiguous/changed/unavailable selected program/map/source evidence holds before effects; semantic re-entry belongs to source owner; freshness is only integrity evidence. After staging recheck preimages/source evidence; report completion only after verifying all selected outputs. Pre-effect refusal preserves prior consumer state; caught failure restores affected preimages and cannot report completion. Require exclusive write scope. Complete-update predicate is every selected binding/companion satisfying accepted plan: witnessed mismatch falsifies, unobserved completion is indeterminate. not_started requires observation at consumer boundary; restore/recovery operation alone does not prove reverted, which requires core observation of every begun part. Preserve staged-install versus consumer boundaries and partial/unknown effects.",
